<mxCell id="n212" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; With i == j the first XOR zeroes the slot and it stays 0. Return early when the indexes match; O(1)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="272" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
